    {
      "id": "t_70bf24803ca70e60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1204,
      "width": 626.2,
      "height": 40.5,
      "text": "Green (#2f9e44) = Infrastructure / Redis core      Pink (#d6336c) = Agent Messaging (Swarm Hardening)\nSolid arrows = primary data flow                    Dashed arrows = dependency / hook\nRedis Streams = ordered append-only log with consumer groups (XREADGROUP, XADD, XACK, XAUTOCLAIM)",
      "originalText": "Green (#2f9e44) = Infrastructure / Redis core      Pink (#d6336c) = Agent Messaging (Swarm Hardening)\nSolid arrows = primary data flow                    Dashed arrows = dependency / hook\nRedis Streams = ordered append-only log with consumer groups (XREADGROUP, XADD, XACK, XAUTOCLAIM)",
      "fontSize": 10,
